.SS "int32_t schultz_label_set_wrap (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, int32_t wrap)"

.PP
Turns a label's wrapping on or off\&. With wrapping off the label is one line however narrow it is given, which is what a button caption or a table cell wants\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree holding the node\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fInode\fP A node created by schultz_label_create\&. 
.br
\fIwrap\fP Nonzero to wrap at the offered width\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
