\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree to create in\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIparent\fP The parent node\&. Must name a live node\&. 
.br
\fIfrom\fP One end, relative to the node's origin\&. 
.br
\fIto\fP The other end\&. 
.br
\fIout_node\fP Receives the new node\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, or an error as above\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_line_set_points (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, \fBschultz_point\fP from, \fBschultz_point\fP to)"

.PP
Moves a line's endpoints\&. 
