\fItree\fP The tree to create in\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIparent\fP The parent node\&. Must name a live node\&. 
.br
\fIpoints\fP The vertices, in order\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIcount\fP How many vertices\&. Must be at least two\&. 
