\fItree\fP The tree holding the node\&. NULL yields the other role\&. 
.br
\fIbutton\fP A child of a button bar\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
One of the SCHULTZ_BUTTON_ROLE_* values\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_button_bar_set_order (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, uint32_t order)"

.PP
Chooses which platform's ordering a bar follows\&. 
