.SS "int32_t schultz_canvas_fill_polygon (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, const \fBschultz_point\fP * points, uint32_t count, \fBschultz_paint\fP paint, uint32_t rule)"

.PP
Records a filled polygon\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree holding the node\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fInode\fP A canvas that is recording\&. 
.br
\fIpoints\fP The vertices, in order\&. Copied\&. 
.br
\fIcount\fP How many\&. Must be greater than zero\&. 
.br
\fIpaint\fP What to fill with\&. 
.br
\fIrule\fP SCHULTZ_FILL_NONZERO or SCHULTZ_FILL_EVEN_ODD, which differ only where the outline crosses itself\&. 
