Adds a tab and gives back its page\&. The first tab added is the one showing\&.
.PP
A page is a container the application arranges however it likes, so it has no pane of its own: give it one, or place its children by hand\&. That is unlike the other containers here, whose content nodes hold one thing and size themselves around it\&.
