SCHULTZ_OK, SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE when the node is not a tab view, SCHULTZ_ERR_EXHAUSTED when it already holds as many tabs as it can, or SCHULTZ_ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY\&. 
