.SS "int32_t schultz_menu_create (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP * out_node)"

.PP
Creates a menu, hidden until it is opened\&. A menu hangs off the root rather than off whatever opens it, because an overlay is its own layout root and its coordinates are the window's\&. It captures while open, so a press anywhere else closes it and does not reach what is underneath\&. Escape closes it too\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree to create in\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIout_node\fP Receives the new node\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_ARGUMENT, or SCHULTZ_ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_menu_add_check (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP menu, const char * text, const char * shortcut, int32_t checked, \fBschultz_handle\fP * out_item)"

.PP
Adds a row that draws a tick when it is on\&. Choosing it flips the tick and \fBleaves the menu open\fP, since these are the rows a user sets several of at once\&. Its state is read and written with schultz_menu_item_checked and schultz_menu_item_set_checked\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree holding the menu\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fImenu\fP A node created by schultz_menu_create\&. 
.br
\fItext\fP What the row says, copied\&. 
.br
\fIshortcut\fP Shortcut text shown on the right, or NULL\&. 
.br
\fIchecked\fP Nonzero to start ticked\&. 
.br
\fIout_item\fP Receives the row\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE, or SCHULTZ_ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_menu_add_radio (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP menu, const char * text, const char * shortcut, uint32_t group, \fBschultz_handle\fP * out_item)"

.PP
Adds a row that is one of a set\&. A set is the rows sharing a menu and a group number, the same rule schultz_radio_create uses with a parent\&. Choosing one clears the rest and leaves the menu open\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree holding the menu\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fImenu\fP A node created by schultz_menu_create\&. 
.br
\fItext\fP What the row says, copied\&. 
.br
