\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The content node, or SCHULTZ_HANDLE_NONE when the node is not a dialog\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_dialog_open (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node)"

