.br
\fIdetail\fP The second line, copied, or NULL for none\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, or SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int32_t schultz_message_dialog_open (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node)"

.PP
Shows the dialog and clears any previous answer\&. \fBPut the keyboard focus inside the dialog after opening it\fP, with schultz_events_set_focus on one of its buttons\&. Enter and Escape reach the dialog by rising from the focused node, so a dialog nothing inside is focused in answers to neither\&. The toolkit cannot do this itself, because focus lives on the event router rather than on the tree\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItree\fP The tree holding the dialog\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fInode\fP A node created by any of the three dialog calls\&. 
.RE
