\fItree\fP The tree holding the view\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fInode\fP A node created by schultz_tree_view_create\&. 
.br
\fIparent_row\fP The row to add under, or SCHULTZ_HANDLE_NONE for the top level\&. 
.br
\fIout_row\fP Receives the new row\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE, or SCHULTZ_ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY\&. 
.RE
.PP

